{"title":"a sudden plunge, istanbul","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-sudden-plunge-istanbul","date":1790228100000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          <a href=\"null\">\n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3fd2fe68-e383-4ab6-a67a-c53c2ced3e19/suddenplunge1.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3fd2fe68-e383-4ab6-a67a-c53c2ced3e19/suddenplunge1.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3fd2fe68-e383-4ab6-a67a-c53c2ced3e19/suddenplunge1.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3fd2fe68-e383-4ab6-a67a-c53c2ced3e19/suddenplunge1.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3fd2fe68-e383-4ab6-a67a-c53c2ced3e19/suddenplunge1.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3fd2fe68-e383-4ab6-a67a-c53c2ced3e19/suddenplunge1.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3fd2fe68-e383-4ab6-a67a-c53c2ced3e19/suddenplunge1.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3fd2fe68-e383-4ab6-a67a-c53c2ced3e19/suddenplunge1.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          </a>\n        \n\n        \n          \n          <figcaption>\n            <p>painted 9/2/2026</p>\n          </figcaption>\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>go to </strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/istanbul\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>istanbul</strong></a><strong> | visit my </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>sketchbook</strong></a><strong> | more </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>visual art</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\n  <p>I felt this image viscerally on the day I landed in istanbul from berlin — right after I exited the metro station at Kadıköy — and felt the sea breeze, the seagulls, the ferry horns, the heavy flowy feeling in the air, like a feeling I wrote about five years ago — falling through water, and being at <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/living-at-the-bottom-of-a-well\" target=\"_blank\">the bottom of a well</a>. <br /><br />I’ve returned to istanbul after an entire year of being away, after deciding to end/dissolve this chapter of my life, only to find that my life is still here, very much breathing, and I’m discovering how to be in a changed relationship to it, again. </p><p>it felt like — a sudden plunge into a complex bath of so many violent, beautiful, painful feelings. it felt bruised, violet, pulsing, tender, alive. I started a new sketchbook with this plunge. it felt like falling into the underworld, where there must be so much growth and transformation, here, for me. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          <a href=\"null\">\n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e8c3c1b5-e803-4b90-ae8c-45cb2685acfa/suddenplunge2.